OL,3,GNEWSAMajor Soho development gets green
OL,4,Alight
OL,5,
OL,6,FPlans for a major development of four
OL,7,Flinked buildings on Soho Square have
OL,8,Fbeen approved by Westminster City
OL,9,FCouncil.
OL,11,FThe project, which includes the former
OL,12,Fhome of 20th Century Fox Film
OL,13,FCorporation, will form part of an
OL,14,Falmost 9,000 square-metre complex
OL,15,Ffeaturing new office space, an archway
OL,16,Fonto Soho Square and retail units.
OL,18,FThe scheme, brought by the Royal London
OL,19,FUK Real Estate Fund, was approved at a
OL,20,Fcommittee meeting on Tuesday, said the
OL,21,FLocal Democracy Reporting Service
OL,22,F(LDRS).
OL,23,APub: 30-OctQppppppppppppppppppppppG1/2
OL,24,ANext PageBLon/SE NewsCReg TVFClean Feed
FL,326,320,200,140,0,100
