OL,3,GNEWSAMajor Soho development gets green
OL,4,Alight
OL,5,
OL,6,FAlistair Martin, from Simten
OL,7,FDevelopments said the project was
OL,8,F"about giving a long, underused part of
OL,9,FSoho a sustainable future, one that
OL,10,Frepresents the very best of Soho".
